    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n21945" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γεράνδρῠον</span></b> , τό,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δρῦς</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>an old tree</i> or <i>stump</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				2.437
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.796b
			</span></i>, etc.: hence of an old person, Aristaen.<i><span class="en">
				2.1
			</span></i>: heterocl. pl., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γεράνδρυες</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> as Adj.,
				<i>old, withered</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				2.7.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				1.1118
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Jul.
				<u>Ep.</u>
				98
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γ. πρέμνα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dsc.
					4.186
				</span></i>
			. (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῡ</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				A.R.
			</span></i> l.c., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῠ</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				9.233
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Eryc.
			</span></i>).)</div>
